flowchart TB 
    USER[Schwab User] 
    SSO[SAML / MySSO] 
    XAPI[Cloud Journey XAPI] 
    IAUTH[Ingress Authorization<br/>User + APM + Role + Action] 
    ROLE[APM / Role API] 
    AGENT[Agent Runtime<br/>Dedicated Agent Identity] 
    GW[Agent Gateway] 
    EAUTH[Egress Authorization<br/>IAM / IAP + Semantic Policy] 
    MA[Model Armor] 
    GMCP[Google Managed MCP] 
    CMCP[Custom MCP<br/>Cloud Run] 
    GCP[GCP Services] 
    ENT[Enterprise APIs] 
    USER --> SSO 
    SSO --> XAPI 
    XAPI --> IAUTH 
    IAUTH --> ROLE 
    ROLE --> IAUTH 
    IAUTH -->|ALLOW + User Context| AGENT 
    AGENT --> GW 
    GW --> EAUTH 
    EAUTH --> MA 
    MA --> GMCP 
    MA --> CMCP 
    GMCP --> GCP 
    CMCP --> ENT